{"availability":{"nextDate":"2026-11-19T09:18:00Z"},"cartItems":null,"consumerAlert":null,"description":"\u003cdiv\u003e \u003cp\u003eLocated in a valley in the inland Algarve, between Portimão and Monchique, the Morgado Golf Course is challenging both to amateurs who are just starting out in the game and to highly-experienced golfers seeking to put their technique to the test. This is a \u003cstrong\u003epar 73\u003c/strong\u003e course but its length is attenuated by the generous width of the fairways. However, you may be penalised if your less successful strokes happen to land in one of the bunkers scattered around the course.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eInstalado num vale no interior algarvio, entre Portimão e Monchique, o Morgado Golf Course constitui um desafio tanto para quem está a dar os primeiros passos no golfe como para o jogador mais experiente e que procura colocar à prova a sua técnica. Este é um campo par 73, mas o comprimento do percurso é atenuado pela largura, generosa, dos fairways. No entanto, as pancadas menos conseguidas poderão sair penalizadas pela acção de um dos vários bunkers distribuídos pelo campo.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003chr\u003e \u003cdiv\u003e \u003cp style=\"font-size: 20px;\"\u003eClub Facilities\u003c/p\u003e \u0026nbsp;\u003ctable style=\"width: 422.5px;\"\u003e \u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e \u003ctd\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://morgadoalamos.golfmanager.com/open/morgadoalamos/inconBuggy.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"39\"\u003e\u003c/td\u003e \u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\"\u003eBuggy\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e \u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e \u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://morgadoalamos.golfmanager.com/open/morgadoalamos/inconShop.jpg\" width=\"40\" height=\"39\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e \u003ctd\u003e\