003e \u003c/table\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cimg   \u003ca=\"\" class=\"lc-widget-badge\"  =\"\" data-id=\"302\" data-origin=\"club-302\" data-width=\"200\" data-year=\"2022\" href=\"https://en.leadingcourses.com/europe+portugal+algarve/morgado-do-reguengo-golf-resort/\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp style=\"font-size: 20px;\"\u003eLocalização/ Location\u003c/p\u003e \u003ciframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3178.14234710131!2d-8.569334284698884!3d37.196848279868775!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0xd1b267af51e345f%3A0x154709b53cbc1813!2sMorgado%20Golf%20Course!5e0!3m2!1sen!2spt!4v1619709786384!5m2!1sen!2spt\" style=\"border:1px solid #999999;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" aria-hidden=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"250\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e \u003c/div\u003e\u003c/img \u003e","id":1,"image":"1619532147939648343Zc82rMvk5.jpg","logo":"1619690294052007706QDFz0LSc3.png","name":"Morgado Golf Course","selectableResource":true},{"description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThis is an impressive golf test. Although the length of the round is relatively short, Álamos Golf Course is a constant challenge. With 18 holes, this is a fairly technical but narrow course, with greens that are smaller and very elaborate, undulating. With superb views towards the hills of Serra de Monchique, lakes and farmland, this course produces relaxation and peacefulness. While a shorter course (\u003cstrong\u003epar 71\u003c/strong\u003e) than Morgado Golf Course, it has all the necessary features to meet the expectations of the most demanding player. More than just a golf test, this course embodies the harmony that can be achieved between humanity and nature.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eApesar do comprimento do seu percurso ser relativamente curto, o Álamos Golf Course constitui um impressionante teste de golfe. Este campo oferece excelentes vistas para a serra de Monchique, lagos e campos agrícolas, havendo a sensação de se estar longe de tudo. É um percurso mais curto (\u003cstrong\u003epar 71\u003c/strong\u003e) do que o Morgado Golf Course, mas tem todas as características necessárias para satisfazer as expetativas do jogador mais exigente. Mais do que um teste de golfe, este é um campo que atesta a harmonia que pode ser alcançada entre o homem e natureza.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003c/div\u003e\r\n\t\u003chr\u003e\r\n\t\u003cdiv\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 20px;\"\u003eClub Facilities\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\t\r\n\t\t \u0026nbsp;\u003ctable style=\"width: 422.5px;\"\u003e\r\n\t\t\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\r\n\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://morgadoalamos.golfmanager.com/open/morgadoalamos/inconBuggy.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"39\"\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\r\n\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\"\u003eBuggy\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\r\n\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\r\n\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://morgadoalamos.golfmanager.com/open/morgadoalamos/inconShop.jpg\" width=\"40\" height=\"39\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\r\n\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\"\u003eGolf Shop\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\r\n\t\t\t\u003c/tr\u003e\r\n\t\t\t\u003ctr\u003e\r\n\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://morgadoalamos.golfmanager.com/open/morgadoalamos/inconRentals.jpg\" width=\"40\" height=\"39\"\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\r\n\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\"\u003eRentals\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\r\n\t\t\t\t\u003ctd\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://morgadoalamos.golfmanager.com/open/morgadoalamos/inconRestaurant.jpg\" width=\"40\" he